# Line endings are identity-bearing in this repository.
#
# The contract artefact's SHA-256 is recorded in V1.8_changelog.md, the review
# handoff and every steering file as
#   b92e53f4ff0541050ec6585f3237f4d764a26e455447a672f3419dfb284fe639
# That value is only valid for the LF form. Git's core.autocrlf would otherwise
# rewrite it to CRLF on checkout and silently invalidate every recorded hash -
# the same defect class that made V1.4-V1.7 hashes platform-specific.
#
# So: LF everywhere, in the working tree and in the index, for every file type.

* text=auto eol=lf

# The contract and all generated artefacts are byte-exact by requirement.
contract/** text eol=lf
.kiro/** text eol=lf
tools/** text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
AGENTS.md text eol=lf

# Genuine binaries: never touch.
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
*.log text eol=lf
